OL,3,ANvidia revenue doubles on continued AI
OL,4,Ademand
OL,5,
OL,6,FChipmaker Nvidia has reported another
OL,7,Fhuge jump in sales as the global push
OL,8,Fto build artificial intelligence (AI)
OL,9,Fsystems continues at a rapid pace.
OL,11,FThe company said on Wednesday it
OL,12,Fbrought in $96bn (#71bn) in revenue
OL,13,Fduring the second quarter, more than
OL,14,Fdouble from a year ago. And it expects
OL,15,Frevenue of $108bn next quarter.
OL,17,F"AI has reached its inflection point,"
OL,18,FCEO Jensen Huang said in prepared
OL,19,Fremarks, describing the infrastructure
OL,20,Fbuildout as going "at full steam."
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
