OL,3,ARocky Horror star Tim Curry dies at 80
OL,4,
OL,5,FEnglish actor Tim Curry, best known for
OL,6,Fplaying the outlandish Frank-N-Furter
OL,7,Fin film musical The Rocky Horror
OL,8,FPicture Show, has died at the age of
OL,9,F80.
OL,11,FCurry first played the role on stage
OL,12,Fbefore the film version, which was
OL,13,Freleased in 1975 and has remained a
OL,14,Fcult favourite.
OL,16,FThe actor also played fearsome clown
OL,17,FPennywise in the 1990 TV version of
OL,18,FStephen King's It, and was Long John
OL,19,FSilver in 1996's Muppet Treasure
OL,20,FIsland.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
